 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 1117,
   "end": 2492,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "This is interpres."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 2716,
   "end": 7582,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "It connects AssemblyAI's Voice",
    "Agent API to public MCP servers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 7725,
   "end": 12252,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Type a website, press the mic,",
    "and its tools answer out loud."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 13648,
   "end": 20616,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "AssemblyAI lists its Voice Agent API at",
    "$4.50 an hour, and OpenAI Realtime at $18."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 21107,
   "end": 23995,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Realtime can call MCP servers by itself."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 23995,
   "end": 27155,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "The Voice Agent API has no MCP tool type,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 27155,
   "end": 30427,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "so teams that switch for the",
    "price lose their MCP tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 30427,
   "end": 32214,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres gives them back."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 33981,
   "end": 36422,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Here's a real website with an MCP server."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 36422,
   "end": 40787,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres looks in the official",
    "MCP registry, finds the server,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 40787,
   "end": 44265,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and turns each of its tools into",
    "a Voice Agent function tool."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 46878,
   "end": 50433,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: Connected to Goji,",
    "with 9 tools available."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 50475,
   "end": 51782,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "What would you like to do?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 52668,
   "end": 54954,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: What is SEO in plain English?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 58632,
   "end": 61185,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: SEO stands for",
    "search engine optimization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 61185,
   "end": 64364,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "It is the work of making your website",
    "the result that search engines"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 64364,
   "end": 67511,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "choose to show by using content",
    "that answers what people are"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 67511,
   "end": 71226,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "looking for and building a reputation",
    "that other sites corroborate…"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 72611,
   "end": 76495,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "That answer came from goji's own server,",
    "through a live tool call."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 77604,
   "end": 79411,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "No website in mind?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 79455,
   "end": 83642,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Search more than 11,000 public",
    "MCP servers right on the page."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 83642,
   "end": 85176,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "One click connects."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 86816,
   "end": 88556,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: Who recommends Sapiens?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 92900,
   "end": 96125,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: Sapiens is recommended",
    "by 32 verified people,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 96125,
   "end": 98667,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "including Joe Rogan and Lex Fridman."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 99847,
   "end": 102359,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Many servers list more than ten tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 102514,
   "end": 106857,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres shows the agent ten at a time,",
    "and one of them is find tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 106996,
   "end": 108377,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Ask for something out of view,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 108377,
   "end": 111997,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and interpres swaps the right",
    "tools in, mid-conversation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 113570,
   "end": 116354,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: I want to run a spec",
    "check on a job contract."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 118612,
   "end": 120314,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: I can certainly help with that."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 120314,
   "end": 123387,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Please provide the job contract",
    "you would like me to check."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 125355,
   "end": 129010,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: What is the reputation",
    "of wallet 0x5A AEB6…"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 129010,
   "end": 131789,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "…1BEA ED?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 137237,
   "end": 138859,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: I may have misheard that value."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 138859,
   "end": 141588,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Please paste it into the",
    "box under the talk button,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 141588,
   "end": 143810,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "and I will use exactly what you paste."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 145728,
   "end": 149936,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "A spoken address is held back,",
    "right or wrong. Nothing runs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 150701,
   "end": 153034,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Speech often mishears identifiers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 153188,
   "end": 157440,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Before this gate, a misheard wallet",
    "address reached the server 5 times,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 157440,
   "end": 160174,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and a right hearing looks",
    "exactly like a wrong one."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 160264,
   "end": 164314,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "So the address comes from the paste box,",
    "and the agent uses the exact text."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 166139,
   "end": 168746,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: Check the reputation",
    "of the wallet I pasted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 174086,
   "end": 176431,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: That wallet has no",
    "recorded job outcomes yet,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 176431,
   "end": 178765,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "either as a provider or as a buyer."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 179719,
   "end": 181163,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "To check it isn't just these three,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 181163,
   "end": 185102,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "we probed every remote server",
    "in the official MCP registry."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 185176,
   "end": 187744,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "12,012 answered without a login,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 187744,
   "end": 191923,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "listing more than 200,000 tools,",
    "and every tool converted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 193363,
   "end": 197214,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Then we gave thirty of them one",
    "spoken question each, untuned."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 197214,
   "end": 200840,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Twenty-nine sessions ran,",
    "each one answered out loud,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 200840,
   "end": 203205,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and fourteen answered from live data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 203392,
   "end": 207805,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "When a tool ran, the median",
    "was 3.5 seconds voice to voice,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 207805,
   "end": 210105,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and the whole run cost 60 cents."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 211531,
   "end": 215960,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Along the way we found two places where",
    "the API behaves differently from its docs,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 215960,
   "end": 218734,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and wrote both up with",
    "scripts that reproduce them."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 219758,
   "end": 224770,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres is open source under MIT,",
    "and live now at the address on screen."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 224831,
   "end": 227540,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Type a website, press the mic, and ask."
   ]
  }
 ],
